"kind":"kdrama","rating":10,"certification":"TV-14","runtime":null},{"id":"cmrhzep9e894ens75hy7wj7k0","title":"Run, Jang Mi","subtitle":"2014 • 15","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfY7vjZSjWUSWsNeyShCrs5EYMF.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wSBpZYCLkWNpu2JpgO3hycU7oU1.jpg","overview":"Jang Mi is a woman with a warm personality which makes her kind to everyone. She is 26-years-old and a graduate student majoring in culinary arts. She was brought up in a wealthy family, but loses everything one day when her father passes away. Jang Mi's life changes completely after her father's death. While Jang-Mi struggles to make a living, she meets a man who is the grandson of a food company president and they become involved romantically.","kind":"kdrama","rating":10,"certification":"15","runtime":35},{"id":"cmrhzifbe8ncmns75syrlc0vx","title":"Family Register","subtitle":"2026 • TV-MA","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NyZYjWNfFmnXBpkdIg4iKIhHqy.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xBFkSHJAco6XCwYZ3YRZc81pn22.jpg","overview":"Judged as a mistress’s daughter, a young woman fights a stigma she never chose. Meanwhile, another woman’s life stands still after her husband's betrayal. Bound together by the death of the man who tore their lives apart, these two apparent enemies are forced to confront one another under one roof. As families scarred by hatred and heartbreak collide, old wounds resurface. Facing years of prejudice, they set out to reclaim their lives and transform their bitter fate into an unexpected family bond.","kind":"kdrama","rating":10,"certification":"TV-MA","runtime":null},{"id":"cmrhzfp0r8cmuns758nvnxnmr","title":"See and See Again","subtitle":"1998 • 15","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKkzRuIhWLFh9a8rhYrPHciSYRf.jpg","backdropUrl":null,"overview":"A family drama about the entangled conflict, love, and reconciliation of the characters around them, centered on Mammal's eldest daughter Jin Ju and Eun Ju's sister Eun Ju, who grew up with her parents' love.","kind":"kdrama","rating":10,"certification":"15","runtime":35},{"id":"cmrg94qzl00qvk90umql3y94f","title":"Teach You a Lesson","subtitle":"2026 • TV-MA","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMECSPrTmRClSViMsXFYmiYIcWP.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vyG93jhmPL7tBIhRtCLa5mdBKob.jpg","overview":"An inspector from the Educational Rights Protection Bureau (ERPB) who is authorized by the government to use physical intervention and unconventional methods to discipline delinquent students and reform the educational system.","kind":"kdrama","rating":9.466,"certification":"TV-MA","runtime":70},{"id":"cmrhzvw7w9t0qns757piyzqfl","title":"Honour","subtitle":"2026 • U/A 16+","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1kQcjue665jjB8AABliD8V9jFL.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fULDivcid9WAuV6hKwobgRhVWD4.jpg","overview":"There's no statute of limitations on revenge. A mystery thriller about three female lawyers who confront the past head-on, as it returns as a massive scandal.","kind":"kdrama","rating":9.2,"certification":"U/A 16+","runtime":null},{"id":"cmrg9669r0abmk90ury2vt6gk","title":"See You at Work Tomorrow!","subtitle":"2026 • TV-G","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTP1MKGz5kIrXCpb3HTgzVyIW6l.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zftF4KDGuhAGIA50bywcCXPjz5f.jpg","overview":"Cha Ji-yoon is a 7th-year corporate worker who's tired of both work and dating. She crosses paths with Kang Si-woo, the cynical boss with a terrifying reputation. Unexpectedly, she regains spark in her life as she gets to know the kindness behind his stern words. Amid repeated commutes, accidents at work, and failed relationships, the two become each other's irreplaceable anchor.","kind":"kdrama","rating":9.1,"certification":"TV-G","runtime":null},{"id":"cmrg96zqe0n22k90u28llm29g","title":"The WONDERfools","subtitle":"2026 • TV-14","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.or